WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.119
In 1985,

2
00:00:01.119 --> 00:00:03.878
Mikhail Gorbachev tried to reform

3
00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:05.617
the Soviet Union.

4
00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:06.726
Six years later,

5
00:00:06.726 --> 00:00:08.051
it was gone.

6
00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:10.700
Glasnost meant openness.

7
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.171
Perestroika meant restructuring the economy.

8
00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:16.904
The Berlin Wall fell in

9
00:00:16.904 --> 00:00:18.597
November 1989.

10
00:00:18.597 --> 00:00:21.343
The Soviet Union dissolved in

11
00:00:21.343 --> 00:00:22.822
December 1991,

12
00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.999
into 15 countries.

13
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.797
The result: a unipolar moment,

14
00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:29.103
with the US as the

15
00:00:29.103 --> 00:00:30.287
only superpower,

16
00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:31.620
for a time.

17
00:00:32.296 --> 00:00:33.567
Your turn.

18
00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:35.770
Into how many countries?
